WEBVTT

00:19:29.371 --> 00:19:31.454
Many of Susan's examples focused

00:19:31.454 --> 00:19:34.246
on how this response can weigh us
down in our personal lives.

00:19:34.788 --> 00:19:39.788
But I want to focus on what it can look
like in our work lives where emotional

00:19:39.788 --> 00:19:43.954
agility can be even more
complicated to start.

00:19:43.996 --> 00:19:48.704
I want to identify two systems of thinking
outlined by behavioral economist

00:19:48.704 --> 00:19:49.704
Daniel Kahneman.

00:19:50.454 --> 00:19:53.954
Simply enough, they're called
System one and System two.

00:19:54.621 --> 00:19:58.371
System one is a mode of thinking that
is quick, instinctive and emotional.

00:19:58.704 --> 00:20:01.204
It tells us that we want to eat the
chocolate cake in the fridge,